From 4444444444444444444444444444444444444444 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Example Author <author@example.invalid>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 10:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] feat: add request parser

Add a parser for plain requests. This gives callers a single boundary
for request validation.
---
 src/request_parser.txt | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 src/request_parser.txt

diff --git a/src/request_parser.txt b/src/request_parser.txt
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..4444444
--- /dev/null
+++ b/src/request_parser.txt
@@ -0,0 +1,2 @@
+parse-request:
+  accept plain input

From 5555555555555555555555555555555555555555 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Example Author <author@example.invalid>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 10:02:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] fixup! feat: add request parser

Reject empty requests so callers receive consistent validation.
---
 src/request_parser.txt | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/src/request_parser.txt b/src/request_parser.txt
index 4444444..5555555 100644
--- a/src/request_parser.txt
+++ b/src/request_parser.txt
@@ -1,2 +1,3 @@
 parse-request:
+  reject empty input
   accept plain input

From 6666666666666666666666666666666666666666 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Example Author <author@example.invalid>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 10:04:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] fix: update request parsing and improve log output

Add nested request support for the updated payload shape. Separately,
change diagnostic prefixes so operators can filter log output.
---
 src/request_parser.txt | 1 +
 src/logging.txt        | 1 +
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 src/logging.txt

diff --git a/src/request_parser.txt b/src/request_parser.txt
index 5555555..6666666 100644
--- a/src/request_parser.txt
+++ b/src/request_parser.txt
@@ -1,3 +1,4 @@
 parse-request:
   reject empty input
   accept plain input
+  accept nested input
diff --git a/src/logging.txt b/src/logging.txt
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..6666666
--- /dev/null
+++ b/src/logging.txt
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+format diagnostic line
